            <Title>Random stuffs</Title>
            <Text>has MIN and MAX

precedence of operators

High to low

	1.	(
	2.	functions
	3.	monadic + - NOT
	4.	^ (Exponentiation)
	5.	* /
	6.	+ -
	7.	MIN MAX
	8.	relational  e.g. =  &lt;&gt;  &lt;= ...
	9.	AND OR
	10.	USING and comma
	11.	) and semicolon
